WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:09.670
What are you pretending for, you have 37.4.

2
00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:12.670
Who says so? – Well, the thermometer says so.

3
00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:15.670
This one of yours is broken!

4
00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:18.670
Don't bring me this thermometer that shows 37.

5
00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:24.670
Bring me a thermometer that shows 42.9 or 39.4, doesn't matter.

6
00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:31.670
I'm here deathly ill, and you bring me a thermometer with 37.
